flowchart LR
  Staff[PSE staff or authorized manager]
  Browser[Browser]
  subgraph Application[Next.js application on proposed Vercel hosting]
    Pages[Pages and reusable components]
    Services[Shared feature services and request authorization]
    Client[Caller-scoped Supabase client]
  end
  subgraph Supabase[Planned Supabase project]
    Auth[Auth identity and verified session]
    subgraph Database[PostgreSQL database foundation]
      RLS[Table grants and active PSE row policies]
      Data[Contacts opportunities meetings activities contributions]
      Targets[Annual plan quarterly baselines allocation grid]
      Guards[Constraints approval locks and audit triggers]
      Audit[Append-only audit history]
    end
  end
  Local[Isolated PGlite PostgreSQL verification]
  Migrations[Versioned SQL migrations]
  Staff --> Browser --> Pages
  Pages -. integration pending .-> Services
  Browser -. sign-in pending .-> Auth
  Auth -. caller identity .-> Client
  Services -. integration pending .-> Client
  Client -. hosted integration pending .-> RLS
  RLS --> Data
  RLS --> Targets
  Data --> Guards
  Targets --> Guards
  Guards --> Audit
  Migrations --> Database
  Migrations --> Local
